---
const faqs = [
  { q: 'What does Hantsaniala Eléo do?', a: 'Hantsaniala is a freelance backend developer specialising in Go and Python. He builds REST APIs, microservices, and cloud infrastructure for startups and small businesses.' },
  { q: 'What technologies does Hantsaniala work with?', a: 'Primary stack is Go (Gin) and Python (Django, DjangoRESTFramework). He also works with Docker, AWS, PostgreSQL, Neovim, and CI/CD pipelines for deployment.' },
  { q: 'How much does freelance backend development cost?', a: 'Rates depend on project scope and complexity. Contact Hantsaniala for a free consultation and quote. He offers both hourly and fixed-price arrangements.' },
  { q: 'Can Hantsaniala help migrate a legacy backend?', a: 'Yes. He has experience migrating legacy PHP and monolith systems to modern Go or Python microservices architectures with zero-downtime deployment strategies.' },
  { q: 'Does Hantsaniala work with international clients remotely?', a: 'Yes. He has worked remotely with US-based companies and is available for international freelance engagements across all time zones.' },
  { q: 'How can I hire Hantsaniala for a project?', a: 'Send an email to hantsaniala@gmail.com with your project details. He typically responds within 24 hours and can start within days of agreeing on scope.' },
];
---

<section id="faq" class="py-24 lg:py-32" data-animate>
  <div class="space-y-10">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <span class="eyebrow mb-4 inline-flex">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="text-display-lg" style="color: var(--text-primary);">
        Frequently Asked<br />Questions
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3">
      {faqs.map((faq) => (
        <details class="group">
          <summary
            class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none px-6 py-5 rounded-2xl font-semibold text-sm transition-all duration-300"
            style="background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--card-border); color: var(--text-primary);"
          >
            <span>{faq.q}</span>
            <i class="ph ph-plus text-primary transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45 flex-shrink-0"></i>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-5 pt-2 rounded-b-2xl" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">{faq.a}</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>

    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      '@context': 'https://schema.org',
      '@type': 'FAQPage',
      mainEntity: faqs.map((faq) => ({
        '@type': 'Question',
        name: faq.q,
        acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: faq.a },
      })),
    })} />
  </div>
</section>
